---
description: Conventions for requested Obsidian wiki work
globs: vault/wiki/**, vault/.raw/**, wiki/**, .raw/**, **/wiki/hot.md, **/wiki/index.md
alwaysApply: false
---

For wiki work, read the relevant vault's own instructions and matching installed
skill. Prefer a repository vault (`vault/wiki/hot.md`, `wiki/hot.md`, then
`.vault-meta/`); use `~/.claude/vault` only as a relevant cross-project fallback.
Read only relevant notes; consult `wiki/index.md` before ingest or broad queries.

For authorized saves, use wikilinks, keep `.raw/` immutable, preserve existing
`wiki/log.md` entries (prepend new entries), keep `wiki/hot.md` under 500 words,
and update `wiki/index.md` on ingest. Do not refresh notes merely because a
session ended. Follow the vault's workflow and advisory locks for writes.
